  text: 'Fuse three. The staff room lights up row by row, and there is her mug beside
    the sink, and a note she left a colleague: "Back Thursday - the kettle forgives
    you."'
  localizationKeys: []
  choices:
  - text: Pour the cold tea out first. Then take the mug.
